{
  "title": "Oven Roasted Uruguayan Chicken Wings Skewers",
  "description": "A lazy Sunday Uruguayan dish featuring chicken wings with a floral and molten flavor, gluten-free-friendly and perfect for a relaxing day.",
  "cuisine": "Uruguayan",
